Authority, which may be used and reproduced freely under the ISO 20022
Intellectual Property Right Policy. Their content is unchanged; line endings
are normalised to LF (iso20022.org serves CRLF) and pain.008.001.02.xsd is
re-indented (whitespace only). They are not the official source:
the sole source of up-to-date ISO 20022 message standards is
https://www.iso20022.org/ (message catalogue, Payments Initiation - pain).

